<title>SINGAPORE: CAM requests share halt ahead of news.</title>
<headline>CAM requests share halt ahead of news.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Precision engineering company CAM International Holdings Ltd said on Tuesday it had requested the Stock Exchange of Singapore to suspend trade in its shares pending an announcement.</p>
<p>No details of the announcement were given in a statement issued by the company.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703011)</p>
</text>
